        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Antagonist</strong> is an intense first-person action and strategy game, entirely developed by a single creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on an abandoned island, surrounded by relentless enemies. The moment the game begins, they charge at you without mercy — and each wave becomes deadlier than the last. Survive, adapt, and defeat them all to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Combat</strong> – Face relentless hordes of enemies in fast-paced, intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Progression</strong> – Each stage brings more enemies, higher difficulty, and new tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> – Fight in a dark, isolated setting where every step could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Challenge</strong> – Endure until the final wave to prove you are the Last Antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.poster.avif?t=1757334314\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.webm?t=1757334314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.mp4?t=1757334314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
